# Reserved for future mes-mode aarch64 mnemonics. Currently empty
# because the M2-Planet path uses macro mnemonics defined in
# lib/m2/aarch64/aarch64_defs.M1; aarch64 has no mes-mode register
# decomposition table analogous to riscv64.M1's RV-style triplets.
# The build pipeline (scripts/mes.kaem) references this file
# unconditionally as lib/${MES_CPU}-mes/${MES_CPU}.M1 — keeping it
# present (even empty) avoids a missing-file kaem failure.
